# 4. ESTABLISH A CLEAR LAYERING ARCHITECTURE

Use a consistent stacking model.

Recommended hierarchy:

```text
LANDING SHELL
│
├── GLOBAL ATMOSPHERE
│   ├── Base background
│   ├── Continuous line field
│   ├── Large atmospheric lighting
│   ├── Procedural glass composition
