The global atmosphere should be behind all content.

Section content must remain independently interactive.

No global background element should intercept pointer events.

### Suggested foundational CSS

Adapt these selectors to the existing codebase.

```css
.landing-shell {
  position: relative;
  isolation: isolate;
  min-height: 100%;
  background: #f8f9fc;
